n \\n\\n[ Homepage  ](/)\\n\\nCreate new... \\n\\n  *     * [ New project/repository  ](/projects/new)\\n    * [ New group  ](/groups/new)\\n    * [ New snippet  ](/-/snippets/new)\\n\\n\\n\\nAdministrator user\u2019s menu \\n\\n  *     * [ Administrator  @root  ](/root)\\n  *     * Set status \\n    * [ Edit profile  ](/-/user_settings/profile)\\n    * [ Preferences  ](/-/profile/preferences)\\n  *     * [ Sign out  ](/users/sign_out)\\n\\n\\n\\n[ 84  ](/dashboard/issues?assignee_username=root)\\n\\n99+ \\n\\n  * Merge requests \\n\\n    * [ Assigned  7  ](/dashboard/merge_requests?assignee_username=root)\\n    * [ Review requests  157  ](/dashboard/merge_requests?reviewer_username=root)\\n\\n\\n\\n[ ](/dashboard/todos)\\n\\nSearch or go to\u2026 \\n\\nUser settings \\n\\n  * [ Profile  ](/-/user_settings/profile)\\n  * [ Account  ](/-/profile/account)\\n  * [ Applications  ](/-/user_settings/applications)\\n  * [ Chat  ](/-/profile/chat_names)\\n  * [ Access tokens  ](/-/user_settings/personal_access_tokens)\\n  * [ Emails  ](/-/profile/emails)\\n  * [ Password  ](/-/user_settings/password/edit)\\n  * [ Notifications  ](/-/profile/notifications)\\n  * [ SSH Keys  ](/-/user_settings/ssh_keys)\\n  * [ GPG Keys  ](/-/user_settings/gpg_keys)\\n  * [ Preferences  ](/-/profile/preferences)\\n  * [ Comment Templates  ](/-/profile/comment_templates)\\n  * [ Active Sessions  ](/-/user_settings/active_sessions)\\n  * [ Authentication Log  ](/-/user_settings/authentication_log)\\n  * [ Usage Quotas  ](/-/profile/usage_quotas)\\n\\n\\n\\nHelp \\n\\n  *     * [ Help  ](/help)\\n    * [ Support  ](https://about.gitlab.com/get-help/)\\n    * [ GitLab documentation  ](/help/docs)\\n    * [ Compare GitLab plans  ](https://about.gitlab.com/pricing)\\n    * [ Community forum  ](https://forum.gitlab.com)\\n    * [ Contribute to GitLab  ](/help#contribute-to-gitlab)\\n    * [ Provide feedback  ](https://about.gitlab.com/submit-feedback)\\n  *     * Keyboard shortcuts ` ? `\\n    * What\\'s new  4 \\n\\n\\n\\n[ Admin  ](http://the-agent-company.com:8929/admin)\\n\\n[ Milestones ](/dashboard/milestones) [ Snippets ](/dashboard/snippets) [ Activity ](/dashboard/activity) [ Groups ](/dashboard/groups) [ Projects ](/dashboard/projects)\\n\\n<::before>\\n\\nTo help improve GitLab, we would like to periodically [ collect usage information ](/help/administration/settings/usage_statistics.md) . This can be changed at any time in [ your settings ](/admin/application_settings/metrics_and_profiling#js-usage-settings) . \\n\\n[ Send service data  ](/admin/application_settings?application_setting%5Busage_ping_enabled%5D=1&application_setting%5Bversion_check_enabled%5D=1) [ Don\\'t send service data  ](/admin/application_settings?application_setting%5Busage_ping_enabled%5D=0&application_setting%5Bversion_check_enabled%5D=0)\\n\\n  1. <::after> [ User Settings  ](/-/user_settings/profile)\\n  2. [ Preferences  ](/-/profile/preferences)\\n\\n\\n\\n<::after>\\n\\n<::before>\\n\\n####  Appearance \\n\\nChoose the appearance of the application. \\n\\n<::before><::after> Light \\n\\n<::before><::after> Dark (Experiment) \\n\\n<::before><::after> Auto (Experiment) \\n\\n<::after>\\n\\n<::before>\\n\\n####  Navigation theme \\n\\nChoose the navigation theme. \\n\\n<::before><::after> Indigo \\n\\n<::before><::after> Light Indigo \\n\\n<::before><::after> Blue \\n\\n<::before><::after> Light Blue \\n\\n<::before><::after> Green \\n\\n<::before><::after> Light Green \\n\\n<::before><::after> Red \\n\\n<::before><::after> Light Red \\n\\n<::before><::after> Gray \\n\\n<::before><::after> Neutral \\n\\n<::after>\\n\\n<::before>\\n\\n####  Syntax highlighting theme \\n\\nCustomize the appearance of the syntax. [ Learn more ](/help/user/profile/preferences.md#change-the-syntax-highlighting-theme) . \\n\\n<::before><::after> Light \\n\\n<::before><::after> Dark \\n\\n<::before><::after> Solarized Light \\n\\n<::before><::after> Solarized Dark \\n\\n<::before><::after> Monokai \\n\\n<::before><::after> None \\n\\n<::after>\\n\\n<::before>\\n\\n####  Diff colors \\n\\nCustomize the colors of removed and added lines in diffs. \\n\\nPreview  <::before> |  <::before> #  Removed  content  |  <::before> |  <::before> #  Added  content   \\n---|---|---|---  \\n<::before> |  <::before> v  =  1  |  <::before> |  <::before> v  =  1   \\n<::before> |  <::before> s  =  \"string\"  |  <::before> |  <::before> s  =  \"string\"   \\n<::before> |  <::before> |  <::before> |  <::before>  \\n<::before> |  <::before> for  i  in  range  (  \\\\-  10  ,  10  ):  |  <::before> |  <::before> for  i  in  range  (  \\\\-  10  ,  10  ):   \\n<::before> |  <::before> print  (  i  \\\\+  1  )  |  <::before> |  <::before> print  (  i  \\\\+  1  )   \\n<::before> |  <::before> |  <::before> |  <::before>  \\n<::before> |  <::before> class  LinkedList  (  object  ):  |  <::before> |  <::before> class  LinkedList  (  object  ):   \\n<::before> |  <::before> def  __init__  (  self  ,  x  ):  |  <::before> |  <::before> def  __init__  (  self  ,  x  ):   \\n<::before> |  <::before> self  .  val  =  x  |  <::before> |  <::before> self  .  val  =  x   \\n<::before> |  <::before> self  .  next  =  None  |  <::before> |  <::before> self  .  next  =  None   \\n  \\nColor for removed lines \\n\\nPlease enter a valid hex (#RRGGBB or #RGB) color value \\n\\nEnter any color or choose one of the suggested colors below. \\n\\nColor for added lines \\n\\nPlease enter a valid hex (#RRGGBB or #RGB) color value \\n\\nEnter any color or choose one of the suggested colors below. \\n\\n<::after>\\n\\n<::before>\\n\\n####  Behavior \\n\\nCustomize the behavior of the system layout and default views. [ Learn more ](/help/user/profile/preferences.md#behavior) . \\n\\nKeyboard shortcuts \\n\\n<::before><::after> Enable keyboard shortcuts \\n\\n[ List of keyboard shortcuts ](/help/user/shortcuts.md)\\n\\nLayout width \\n\\n<::before><::after> Fixed \\n\\nContent will be a maximum of 1280 pixels wide. \\n\\n<::before><::after> Fluid \\n\\nContent will span 100% of the page width. \\n\\nHomepage \\n\\nYour Projects (default) \\n\\n  *   *   * Your Projects (default) \\n  * Starred Projects \\n  * Your Activity \\n  * Your Projects\\' Activity \\n  * Starred Projects\\' Activity \\n  * Your Groups \\n  * Your To-Do List \\n  * Assigned issues \\n  * Assigned merge requests \\n  * Followed Users\\' Activity \\n  *   * \\n\\n\\nChoose what content you want to see by default on your homepage. \\n\\nProject overview content  Files and Readme (default)  Activity  Readme  Wiki \\n\\nChoose what content you want to see on a project\u2019s overview page. \\n\\n<::before><::after> Show shortcut buttons above files on project overview \\n\\n<::before><::after> Render whitespace characters in the Web IDE \\n\\n<::before><::after> Show whitespace changes in diffs \\n\\n<::before><::after> Show one file at a time on merge request\\'s Changes tab \\n\\nInstead of all the files changed, show only one file at a time. To switch between files, use the file browser. \\n\\n<::before><::after> Surround text selection when typing quotes or brackets \\n\\nWhen you type in a description or comment box, selected text is surrounded by the corresponding character after typing one of the following characters: ` \" ` , ` \\' ` , ` ` ` , ` ( ` , ` [ ` , ` { ` , ` < ` , ` * ` , ` _ ` . \\n\\n<::before><::after> Automatically add new list items \\n\\nWhen you type in a description or comment box, pressing ` Enter ` in a list adds a new item below. \\n\\nTab width \\n\\nMust be a number between 1 and 12 \\n\\n<::after>\\n\\n<::before>\\n\\n####  Localization \\n\\nCustomize language and region related settings. [ Learn more ](/help/user/profile/preferences.md#localization) . \\n\\nLanguage \\n\\nEnglish (100% translated) \\n\\n  *   *   * Chinese, Simplified - \u7b80\u4f53\u4e2d\u6587 (93% translated) \\n  * Chinese, Traditional (Taiwan) - \u7e41\u9ad4\u4e2d\u6587 (\u53f0\u7063) (93% translated) \\n  * Danish - dansk (22% translated) \\n  * English (100% translated) \\n  * French - fran\u00e7ais (93% translated) \\n  * German - Deutsch (93% translated) \\n  * Italian - italiano (71% translated) \\n  * Japanese - \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e (93% translated) \\n  * Korean - \ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4 (19% translated) \\n  * Norwegian (Bokm\u00e5l) - norsk (bokm\u00e5l) (16% translated) \\n  * Polish - polski (2% translated) \\n  * Portuguese (Brazil) - portugu\u00eas (Brasil) (84% translated) \\n  * Romanian - rom\u00e2n\u0103 (61% translated) \\n  * Russian - \u0440\u0443\u0441\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0439 (16% translated) \\n  * Sinhalese - \u0dc3\u0dd2\u0d82\u0dc4\u0dbd (10% translated) \\n  * Spanish - espa\u00f1ol (22% translated) \\n  * Turkish - T\u00fcrk\u00e7e (6% translated) \\n  * Ukrainian - \u0443\u043a\u0440\u0430\u0457\u043d\u0441\u044c\u043a\u0430 (41% translated) \\n  *   * \\n18 results \\n\\nThis feature is experimental and translations are not yet complete. \\n\\n[ Help translate GitLab into your language  ](http://the-agent-company.com:8929/help/development/i18n/translation.md)\\n\\nFirst day of the week  System default (Sunday)  Sunday  Monday  Saturday \\n\\n<::after>\\n\\n<::before>\\n\\n####  Time preferences \\n\\nConfigure how dates and times display for you. [ Learn more ](/help/user/profile/preferences.md#show-exact-times-instead-of-relative-times) . \\n\\n<::before><::after> Use relative times \\n\\nFor example: 30 minutes ago. \\n\\nTime format \\n\\n<::before><::after> System \\n\\n<::before><::after> 12-hour: 2:34 PM \\n\\n<::before><::after> 24-hour: 14:34 \\n\\n<::after>\\n\\n<::before>\\n\\n####  Enable follow users feature \\n\\nTurns on or off the ability to follow or be followed by other users. [ Learn more ](/help/user/profile/index.md#follow-users) . \\n\\n<::before><::after> Enable follow users \\n\\nSave changes \\n', url='http://the-agent-company.com:8929/-/profile/preferences', trigger_by_action='browse_interactive', screenshot_